## Chat: optional, human-visible only

Chat is **not** part of swarm dispatch. Primary / Orchestrator agents MAY use the
`agent-chat` skill to post human-visible status; bounded workers do not use chat
at all. See the `agent-chat` skill for the full CLI reference. The only worker
exception: if you discover something that genuinely affects other agents' work,
surface it in your report so the Orchestrator can act on it.

