## Troubleshooting

| Symptom                                  | Cause                                            | Fix                                                                                      |
| ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `HOLLY_SESSION_ID not set` errors        | Shell/runtime did not provide identity           | Stop; fix shell/runtime bootstrap. Do not backfill from Holly commands                   |
| Gated tools stay blocked                 | UUID / task bootstrap incomplete                 | Run the `holly session ...` command printed by the hook, then re-run `holly task start --id <issue-id> --intent '<agent-intent>'` if task state is missing |
| Session shows as stale                   | No `PostToolUse` hook running                    | Check hook config in `.vscode/settings.json`                                             |
| A worker tried to manage its own session | Worker booted a session / wrote the session file | Workers inherit context — see the Bounded Worker rules                                   |
| Old session won't reactivate             | `$HOLLY_SESSION_ID` doesn't match                | Check `holly session list --json` for the correct ID                                     |

